riendship with Veya is secured.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts","title":"The Drift Continues","summary":"Back at Silverspine, Veya publishes her charts openly and honours her mentor, while Kael sends the Cartel's ledgers to be audited alongside them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants her mentor's theory recognised and the charts made public, and Kael wants to rebuild the Cartel's place in the new order.","conflict":"Academy elders resist the theory, and Kael's pride resists the audit.","outcome":"The theory is accepted and the isles keep drifting but now stay linked through shared upkeep, while Veya and Kael settle into wary respect.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven","scn_hollow_harvest"]}]}]}
