ost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to claim the charts through wind-debt, and Veya wants to keep them.","conflict":"The wind-debt rule gives Kael a legal claim, and Veya's pride keeps her from admitting she cannot repay it in time.","outcome":"Veya offers to repay in labour at the forge instead, and Kael agrees to attend the parley to watch her.","depends_on":["scn_enforcers_close_in","scn_wardens_of_emberroost"]},{"id":"scn_spark_in_the_forge","title":"A Spark in the Forge","summary":"During preparations, a spark escapes a shielded forge-pit and nearly severs a key skybridge cable. Suspicion falls on the Cartel, and Veya's wind-sight lets her spot the real weakness before the cable fails.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Everyone wants to save the cable, and each wants to avoid blame.","conflict":"The Wardens blame Kael while Kael blames the Wardens' neglect, and Maris's old distrust threatens to break the fragile alliance.","outcome":"Veya and Kael cooperate to save the cable, which shows both sides that the bridges will fail without a truce, and the parley goes ahead.","depends_on":["scn_wind_debt_ambush"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Accord","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_parley_opens","title":"Three Banners at the Forge","summary":"The Bridge Wardens, Drift Cartel, and Hollow Circle gather at Emberroost. Veya lays out the charts, Kael defends the tolls and Maris speaks for the Hollow.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Forge a truce that keeps the stable routes open for all three factions.","conflict":"Kael demands exclusive control of the stable routes, Maris demands an end to the grain levy, and Veya must choose between hoarding her charts and sharing them.","outcome":"The talks deadlock when Kael proposes buying the charts outright, which forces Veya to decide.","depends_on":["scn_spark_in_the_forge"]},{"id":"scn_the_choice","title":"Truths Shared","summary":"Veya admits her earlier errors and publicly shares her complete charts. Kael sees that controlling the routes will cost more than shared stewardship would, and he drops his claim.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Break the deadlock and sign a truce.","conflict":"Veya's pride and Kael's belief that price equals worth both resist the change, and Maris must decide whether to trust either of them.","outcome":"Kael waives the wind-debt and levy in exchange for Warden-maintained routes, Maris vouches for the deal for the Hollow, and the Accord is signed.","depends_on":["scn_parley_opens"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Accord","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_cables_rewoven","title":"Cables Rewoven","summary":"Under the Accord, Wardens, Cartel labour and Hollow grain are pooled at Emberroost to braid new cloudstone cables for the failing bridges, with Veya's charts guiding the work.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Begin reinforcing the stable routes under the Accord.","conflict":"Old resentments between Wardens and Cartel crews flare, and Kael struggles to loosen his grip on control.","outcome":"Kael accepts shared oversight, and the first reinforced bridge holds, which proves the Accord can work.","depends_on":["scn_the_choice"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"A Fed Archipelago","summary":"Grain moves openly from The Hollow along the secured routes, and Maris finally stops smuggling and chooses to rely on others.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Deliver grain safely and openly under the Accord.","conflict":"Maris must decide whether to trust the Accord after years of hiding, and Veya must keep the charts updated without claiming sole credit.","outcome":"Maris accepts that hiding was brave but standing openly is stronger, and her friendship with Veya is secured.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts","title":"The Drift Continues","summary":"Back at Silverspine, Veya publishes her charts openly and honours her mentor, while Kael sends the Cartel's ledgers to be audited alongside them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants her mentor's theory recognised and the charts made public, and Kael wants to rebuild the Cartel's place in the new order.","conflict":"Academy elders resist the theory, and Kael's pride resists the audit.","outcome":"The theory is accepted and the isles keep drifting but now stay linked through shared upkeep, while Veya and Kael settle into wary respect.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven","scn_hollow_harvest"]}]}]}
