},{"id":"scn_the_choice","title":"Truths Shared","summary":"Veya admits her earlier errors and publicly shares her complete charts. Kael sees that controlling the routes will cost more than shared stewardship would, and he drops his claim.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Break the deadlock and sign a truce.","conflict":"Veya's pride and Kael's belief that price equals worth both resist the change, and Maris must decide whether to trust either of them.","outcome":"Kael waives the wind-debt and levy in exchange for Warden-maintained routes, Maris vouches for the deal for the Hollow, and the Accord is signed.","depends_on":["scn_parley_opens"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Accord","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_cables_rewoven","title":"Cables Rewoven","summary":"Under the Accord, Wardens, Cartel labour and Hollow grain are pooled at Emberroost to braid new cloudstone cables for the failing bridges, with Veya's charts guiding the work.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Begin reinforcing the stable routes under the Accord.","conflict":"Old resentments between Wardens and Cartel crews flare, and Kael struggles to loosen his grip on control.","outcome":"Kael accepts shared oversight, and the first reinforced bridge holds, which proves the Accord can work.","depends_on":["scn_the_choice"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"A Fed Archipelago","summary":"Grain moves openly from The Hollow along the secured routes, and Maris finally stops smuggling and chooses to rely on others.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Deliver grain safely and openly under the Accord.","conflict":"Maris must decide whether to trust the Accord after years of hiding, and Veya must keep the charts updated without claiming sole credit.","outcome":"Maris accepts that hiding was brave but standing openly is stronger, and her friendship with Veya is secured.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts","title":"The Drift Continues","summary":"Back at Silverspine, Veya publishes her charts openly and honours her mentor, while Kael sends the Cartel's ledgers to be audited alongside them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants her mentor's theory recognised and the charts made public, and Kael wants to rebuild the Cartel's place in the new order.","conflict":"Academy elders resist the theory, and Kael's pride resists the audit.","outcome":"The theory is accepted and the isles keep drifting but now stay linked through shared upkeep, while Veya and Kael settle into wary respect.","depends_on":["scn_cables_rewoven","scn_hollow_harvest"]}]}]}
